  <!-- ===== Linker Hand O6, MIRRORED to left, mounted on the wrist =====
       xyz = centre of the Lwrist1_Link distal flange (local z = -65.6 mm)
       rpy = (pi, 0, gamma): turns the hand to point along the wrist -Z.
       gamma (the 3rd value) swings the palm about the mounting axis:
         0        palm faces  +X of Lwrist1_Link
         1.5708   palm faces  +Y
         3.1416   palm faces  -X
        -1.5708   palm faces  -Y
       Adjust xyz/rpy here if the real bracket differs. -->
